s per controller.\", \"sku\": \"BL-SHF188\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-shf188\", \"category\": \"shelf-edge\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-shf188.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 200, \"highPrice\": 1500, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-shf188\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.86mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"3,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"240 x 48 per module\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 1.86mm, providing high-resolution visuals ideal for close-range viewing on retail shelves.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is this LED display and where is it best used?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 3,000 nits, it is perfect for well-lit retail environments such as convenience stores and duty-free shops where visibility is critical.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm display both video and QR codes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it supports dynamic content including QR codes, videos, and animations to enhance customer engagement directly at the shelf edge.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation options for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Featuring an ultra-thin 28mm profile and a 90-degree rotation capability, it easily fits irregular shelf shapes and can be daisy-chained up to 20 modules per controller for large-scale rollouts.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm compare to traditional shelf-edge displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to traditional displays, the SMD 1.8mm offers finer pixel pitch, higher brightness, and more flexible content options, delivering superior visual impact and versatility.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the power consumption per module?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Each module consumes 6W of power, making it energy-efficient and cost-effective for continuous retail use.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty does this product come with?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a standard warranty covering parts and labor, ensuring reliable performance with after-sales support. Specific warranty terms can be discussed upon inquiry.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm suitable for large retail chains?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, its cost-effective pricing and daisy-chaining capability up to 20 modules make it ideal for extensive deployments in large retail chains and convenience stores.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-shf188\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm</h1><p>Get the ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm LED display in Dubai for dynamic retail visuals. Contact Brightluxx UAE for advanced LED solutions today!</p><p><strong>Budget shelf display. Big impact.</strong></p><p>Cost-effective SMD shelf-edge display for large-scale retail rollouts. 28mm ultra-thin design with 90-degree rotation for irregular shelf shapes. Supports QR codes, video, and animated promotions. Daisy-chain up to 20 modules per controller.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 1.86mm, providing high-resolution visuals ideal for close-range viewing on retail shelves.</p><h3>How bright is this LED display and where is it best used?</h3><p>With a brightness of 3,000 nits, it is perfect for well-lit retail environments such as convenience stores and duty-free shops where visibility is critical.</p><h3>Can the ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm display both video and QR codes?</h3><p>Yes, it supports dynamic content including QR codes, videos, and animations to enhance customer engagement directly at the shelf edge.</p><h3>What are the installation options for this product?</h3><p>Featuring an ultra-thin 28mm profile and a 90-degree rotation capability, it easily fits irregular shelf shapes and can be daisy-chained up to 20 modules per controller for large-scale rollouts.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/