chema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-shf188\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.86mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"3,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"240 x 48 per module\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:T96e,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 1.86mm, providing high-resolution visuals ideal for close-range viewing on retail shelves.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is this LED display and where is it best used?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 3,000 nits, it is perfect for well-lit retail environments such as convenience stores and duty-free shops where visibility is critical.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm display both video and QR codes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it supports dynamic content including QR codes, videos, and animations to enhance customer engagement directly at the shelf edge.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation options for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Featuring an ultra-thin 28mm profile and a 90-degree rotation capability, it easily fits irregular shelf shapes and can be daisy-chained up to 20 modules per controller for large-scale rollouts.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"