.</strong></p><p>Cost-effective SMD shelf-edge display for large-scale retail rollouts. 28mm ultra-thin design with 90-degree rotation for irregular shelf shapes. Supports QR codes, video, and animated promotions. Daisy-chain up to 20 modules per controller.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 1.86mm, providing high-resolution visuals ideal for close-range viewing on retail shelves.</p><h3>How bright is this LED display and where is it best used?</h3><p>With a brightness of 3,000 nits, it is perfect for well-lit retail environments such as convenience stores and duty-free shops where visibility is critical.</p><h3>Can the ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm display both video and QR codes?</h3><p>Yes, it supports dynamic content including QR codes, videos, and animations to enhance customer engagement directly at the shelf edge.</p><h3>What are the installation options for this product?</h3><p>Featuring an ultra-thin 28mm profile and a 90-degree rotation capability, it easily fits irregular shelf shapes and can be daisy-chained up to 20 modules per controller for large-scale rollouts.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm LED Display - Retail LED Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Get the ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm LED display in Dubai for dynamic retail visuals. Contact Brightluxx UAE for advanced LED solutions today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-shf188\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T5b8,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"ShelfEdge SMD 1.8mm\", \"description\": \"Cost-effective SMD shelf-e